@Model.Email

// Secure code using encryption
@Encrypt(Model.Email)
```

### 4. XML External Entity (XXE)

**GDPR Relevance**: XXE vulnerabilities can lead to unauthorized access to sensitive data, violating GDPR’s data protection requirements.

**PHP Example**:

```php
<?php
// Vulnerable code
$dom = new DOMDocument();
$dom->loadXML($_POST['xml']);

// Secure code
